li-ix-p3 : Block
li-ix-p3 = prose (cons "The refusal keyed to a word is wrong by construction. Let o map a message to whether it contains the word. A question about mechanism and a request for hateful content both have o = true and call for different responses; no response policy that factors through o is correct on both (the two-bit calculation, hyperactivity v31, §1, “A reversible whole with no observed law”). A machine trained on the majority's reflex inherits the majority's failure of invariance: it answers the frame, not the object." nil)
